      "role": "CANDIDATE",
      "source_variant_note": "MingCute publishes the same Core Regular geometry twice inside this commit: assets/svg/core/regular/<category>/<name>.svg hardcodes stroke=\"#10161F\", while packages/svg/core-regular/<name>.svg carries stroke=\"currentColor\". The specimen consumes the currentColor distribution so that all three columns inherit one foreground colour. Both are upstream-authored; the path data differs only in encoding, not in shape, and nothing was redrawn locally."
    },
